{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56976","headline":"王仁裕引谚 二 · 佚名","name":"王仁裕引谚 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云两角，去天一握。\n（见《类说》卷五四《玉堂闲话》引）（〖1〗《玉堂闲话》云：「兴元中，有南路通巴州，其峭岩顶谓之『孤云两角』，谚云〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}